# Restaurant order ticket footer (desktop / admin, non-waiter)

Always **3 rows**:

1. `.rst-order__kds` — «Отправить заказ» (full width)
2. `.rst-order__hero--bill` — «Выставить счёт» (full width)
3. `.rst-order__actions` — «Оплатить» + Скидка + Отменить (`auto-fit`: 2 equal if two visible, 3 equal when a third appears)

Pay is **never** a hero under bill — it stays in the bottom row with the rest.

Waiter footer keeps compact `auto-fit` with send/bill/pay in the actions row.
